# Workspace export encapsulation

Canonical reference for Phase 6 P2 export surfaces across all workspaces (`denali`, `urban`, `starter`, `guest-club`).

## Contract vs host

| Layer | `package.json` keys | Consumer rule |
| ----- | ------------------- | ------------- |
| **Plugin contract** | `.`, `./plugin`, `./theme/*`, `./settings/*` | Registry, theme loaders, settings enrichers, operator settings surfaces |
| **Host modules** | `./host/*` | API HTTP wiring, wizard UI, finance, photos, smoke fixtures |

Root barrel (`@app-tour/workspace-*`) must **only** re-export plugin contract symbols. Platform settings dispatch imports **`./settings/...`**; other host wiring uses explicit `./host/...` subpaths (or `./plugin`).

## Settings contract revert (2026-07)

Phase 6 P2 briefly moved settings modules under `./host/settings/*`. That coupled `apps/api` to Denali host internals. Settings modules declared in manifest (`settingsEnrichers`, `devBootstrap`, settings web surfaces) now export as **`./settings/*`** again; codegen `importSpecifier()` preserves the manifest path without `/host/` prefix.

## Migration (post-P2 completion)

| Former | Target |
| ------ | ------ |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/settings/*` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/settings/*` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali` (finance, photos, draft, acl, smoke) | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/<module>` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali` (`getWorkspacePlugin` / legacy `getDenaliWorkspacePlugin`) | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/plugin` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-urban` (`URBAN_SMOKE_*`, validation) | `@app-tour/workspace-urban/host/smoke/*` or `/host/http` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-urban` (`getUrbanWorkspacePlugin`) | `@app-tour/workspace-urban/plugin` |

Codemod: `node scripts/codemods/retarget-denali-urban-root-imports.mjs`

## CI

- `pnpm run guard:workspace-export-surface` — export key allowlist (contract + `./settings/*` + `./host/*` only; Wave E.a dropped legacy `./finance` / `./booking` on finance/booking fixture workspaces — see [`wave-e-encapsulation-guards.mdoc`](./wave-e-encapsulation-guards.mdoc))
- `pnpm run guard:denali-plugin-surface` / `guard:urban-plugin-surface` — `./plugin` symbol allowlist

See also: [`denali-plugin-encapsulation.mdoc`](denali-plugin-encapsulation.mdoc) for codegen `importSpecifier()` rules and migration map.
